    Bug 2013259 - Migrate folderWidgets.properties to Fluent. r=mkmelin,coreycb

    - Migrates strings from folderWidgets.properties to a new folderWidgets.ftl file.
    - Refactors folder-menupopup.js to use the Fluent Localization API.
    - Redirects verboseFolderFormat in virtualFolderProperties.js to
      messenger.properties to allow for the total removal of folderWidgets.properties.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D280926

